      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Apply Connect certification",
      "Anchor": "apply-connect-certification",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Apply Connect certification process ensures official certification of LinkedIn Apply Connect.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Apply Connect certification",
      "Anchor": "apply-connect-certification",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "To achieve certification, review and complete all applicable test cases for each development module. Schedule certification demos with your LinkedIn Business Development contact in any order once development and testing are complete.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Apply Connect certification",
      "Anchor": "apply-connect-certification",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "During demos, cover all module-specific test cases. If any test cases don\u0027t apply to your integration, notify your business development contact in advance.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Apply Connect certification",
      "Anchor": "apply-connect-certification",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "LinkedIn certifies integrations based on complete coverage of the test cases in the certification demos. Upon successful certification, LinkedIn provisions your production API key.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Apply Connect certification",
      "Anchor": "apply-connect-certification",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Review and understand the test cases for each module to ensure a successful certification process.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Apply Connect certification",
      "Anchor": "apply-connect-certification",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Apply Connect certification",
      "Anchor": "apply-connect-certification",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Schedule certification demos with your LinkedIn Business Development contact in any module order once development and testing are complete.\nCover all module-specific test cases during demos. If test cases don\u0027t apply to your integration, notify your business development contact proactively.\nLinkedIn certifies integrations based on complete test case coverage.\nUpon successful certification, LinkedIn provisions your Production API Key.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
